<title>USA: Tellabs equipment used by Telia.</title>
<headline>Tellabs equipment used by Telia.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Wednesday Sweden-based Telia is using the company's new interface product to increase service capacity on its existing cellular phone network.</p>
<p>Telia has deployed Tellabs' synchronous digital hierarchy GMU interface, for use on its DXX system, also a Tellabs product.</p>
<p>Tellabs provides network systems and services to communications services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
